---
import {pct} from '../lib/content';
const {metrics:m,recent=null}=Astro.props;
const recentDays=recent?.longest_time_underwater_days;
---
<dl class="method-metrics">
  <div><dt>연평균 복리수익률 <abbr title="Compound Annual Growth Rate">CAGR</abbr></dt><dd>{pct(m.cagr)}{recent&&<small>({pct(recent.cagr)})</small>}</dd></div>
  <div><dt>최대 낙폭 <abbr title="Maximum Drawdown">MDD</abbr></dt><dd>{pct(m.mdd)}{recent&&<small>({pct(recent.mdd)})</small>}</dd></div>
  <div><dt>최장 고점 미회복 기간</dt><dd>{m.longest_time_underwater_days}<small>일{recentDays!=null&&` (${recentDays}일)`}</small></dd></div>
  <div><dt>연평균 거래</dt><dd>{Number(m.annual_trades).toFixed(1)}<small>회{recent?.annual_trades!=null&&` (${Number(recent.annual_trades).toFixed(1)}회)`}</small></dd></div>
</dl>
